NODE id=matrix/cortex/query.evaluator.eval kind=method
  digest=b3:0a0d42f9767486405ffedbde27d04b676804bb2c8e251e092e7b9927efab0717 file=cortex/query/eval.go range=246:342 lang=go exported=false byte_range=6626:8860
  sig=func (ev *evaluator) eval(p Predicate, m *memory.Memory, data memory.TypedData) (bool, error)
  doc=eval recursively evaluates a Predicate against (m, data). Returns false\n(no error) for an unknown field on Eq/Ne/In/HasTag — those are "this\nmemory simply doesn't satisfy the predicate" signals. Gt/Gte/Lt/Lte/\nMatches return ErrFieldUnknown to surface schema typos.
