NODE id=matrix/cortex/query.trimByBudget kind=func
  digest=b3:365a5c7969343ef4a04f2720f610c0bc19e218f71a5c40befcc3fd52cd6d6f0a file=cortex/query/find.go range=558:622 lang=go exported=false byte_range=20426:22320
  sig=func trimByBudget(res *Result, budget int)
  doc=trimByBudget drops low-salience entries until the rendered token sum is\n≤ budget. Trimming proceeds by salience asc regardless of OrderBy; the\nsurviving entries are returned in their original (OrderBy-sorted) order.\nAt least one memory is always retained when the input is non-empty so\nthe caller doesn't get an empty result on a too-tight budget; the result\nmay exceed budget by exactly that one item's tokens (the best we can do\nwithout rendering an even shorter form).
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/query/find.go

